title: InnerDialogue_Truth
---
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Lady}: Hiki... can you hear me?
{$Hiki}: (Silent)
{$Lady}: I know you're there, Hiki!
{$Hiki}: Hello? Who's speaking to me?
{$Lady}: You’ve come far... but you’re still hiding something.
-> “I’m not hiding anything.” 
    {$Lady}: Lies are heavier when you believe them.
-> “Maybe you’re right.”
    {$Lady}: Then why keep walking in circles?
-> [silent]
    {$Lady}: Silence isn’t peace.
===